OL,3,GNEWSA'Shock and awe' for dad at police
OL,4,Adaughter's response to huge fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Andy Beasley thinks about what his
OL,7,Fdaughter did to help, at a huge fire in
OL,8,FStoke-on-Trent, he has two words -
OL,9,F"shock" and "awe".
OL,11,FAs the blaze broke out in Sandyford
OL,12,Flast week, Hannah was on the way to
OL,13,Fanother job but was diverted and
OL,14,Farrived as the flames were raging - and
OL,15,Fbefore the first fire engine had
OL,16,Farrived.
OL,18,F"She was straight in, evacuating
OL,19,Fresidents from their homes," her father
OL,20,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
