OL,3,GNEWSA'Shock and awe' for dad at police
OL,4,Adaughter's response to huge fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen he phoned her to check on her,
OL,7,FHannah told him she had taken on smoke,
OL,8,Fthere was black soot coming out of her
OL,9,Fnose and even her fake eyelashes had
OL,10,Fmelted.
